@startuml
title Sequence: Пользователь включает отопление (sync flow)

actor "Пользователь" as user
participant "Веб-интерфейс" as web
participant "API Gateway" as gw
participant "Climate Service" as climate
participant "Device Gateway" as dgw
participant "Connection Manager" as cm
participant "Third-Party API" as api
participant "Kafka" as broker
participant "db_climate" as db_c
participant "db_device" as db_d

user -> web: Нажать «Включить отопление»
web -> gw: POST /api/climate/heating\n{house_id, mode: "auto", target_temp: 22}
activate gw

gw -> gw: Валидация JWT-токена
gw -> climate: gRPC SetHeatingMode(house_id, AUTO, 22.0)
activate climate

climate -> db_c: SELECT * FROM heating_modes WHERE house_id = ?
activate db_c
db_c --> climate: Текущее состояние: OFF, current_temp=18.5
deactivate db_c

climate -> db_c: UPDATE heating_modes SET mode=AUTO, target_temp=22, is_active=true
activate db_c
db_c --> climate: OK
deactivate db_c

climate -> dgw: gRPC SendDeviceCommand(device_id, SET_TEMPERATURE, {temp:22})
activate dgw

dgw -> dgw: Command Router: валидация, определение типа = TEMPERATURE_SENSOR
dgw -> cm: SendWithRetry(command)
activate cm

cm -> cm: Circuit breaker: состояние CLOSED — пропустить
cm -> api: POST /api/devices/{id}/command\n{"command":"set_temperature","value":22}
activate api

api -> api: Команда датчику
api --> cm: 200 OK {"status":"accepted","request_id":"ext-123"}
deactivate api

cm --> dgw: CommandResult{Success: true, ExternalRequestID: "ext-123"}
deactivate cm

dgw -> db_d: INSERT INTO device_log (device_id, command, result, timestamp)
activate db_d
db_d --> dgw: OK
deactivate db_d

dgw --> climate: CommandResult{Success: true}
deactivate dgw

climate -> broker: Produce HeatingStateChanged{house_id, mode:AUTO, active:true}
activate broker
broker --> climate: ACK
deactivate broker

climate --> gw: SetHeatingModeResponse{success: true}
deactivate climate

gw --> web: 200 OK {"status":"heating_on", "target_temp": 22}
deactivate gw

web --> user: «Отопление включено, целевая температура 22°C»

note over broker, security
  Асинхронно:
  Security & Monitoring подписан на
  topic climate.events → фиксирует изменение
  в event_log, проверяет правила.
end note

@enduml